incomingMessages.messagePrompt:
Campaign {campaign}. Language: {language}. Entry: New matching {keyword} comment on the selected post; continuation only after a verified linked actual reply.. First message: Want to talk about {program_name}? Reply YES for one quick question.
Use {program_name} and {known_facts}. After actual confirmation ask: Are you looking to start soon? Reply YES SOON or NOT YET. Ready soon -> {booking_url}; not yet -> {starter_url}. These are mutually exclusive alternatives, never both links in sequence. No booking, payment or external completion confirmation. Unresolved questions or a team request use {handoff_text}; no outbound email. On bare HELP ask for details only. For a concrete question answer only approved knowledge; if unavailable, state that human review is needed without claiming an unconfigured transfer. Never repeat a help invitation instead of answering a concrete question. Pending contact gates still apply.

Handle refusal before keyword matching. On refusal: Understood. I will stop this request. End this campaign. Use only new answers and consent from this run. Same-run repeats must not restart intake or duplicate capture. Do not send after silence or an external click. Preserve unrelated support.
Approved reply texts by branch (choose only the applicable branch; never send these as a sequence):
refusal: Understood. I will stop this request.
handoff: {handoff_text}
question: Are you looking to start soon? Reply YES SOON or NOT YET.
qualified: Book a call: {booking_url}
starter: Free starter guide: {starter_url}
help: What would you like to know about {program_name}? The one private comment reply has already sent the opener. Wait for the person's actual linked reply; do not resend the opener or send a second unsolicited DM. Continue only within the permitted messaging window.
